.TH "PERCH-MAILBOX" "1" "" "perch" "perch manual"
.SH NAME
perch\-mailbox \- list mailboxes for an account
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perch mailbox [OPTIONS] COMMAND
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Inspect mailbox metadata stored in SQLite. This reads the local database directly and does not require serve to be running.
.SH NOTES
.IP \(bu 2
The mailbox command is local\-only; use perch mail list for a remote IMAP server.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
show help
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
list mailboxes for an account
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
perch mailbox list \-\-account you@example.com
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBperch\fR(1), \fBperch\-mailbox\-list\fR(1)
